  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Artificial Intelligence in the Energy Market: USA-Netherlands Comparative Study on Grid Optimisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study delivers a comparative report and presentation on how AI can optimize electricity grid management in the USA and the Netherlands. It maps key grid challenges, leading technologies, innovation hubs, and policy drivers, identifying 3-5 opportunities for bilateral R&amp;D and pilot collaboration.The results will feed into a USA-Netherlands &quot;AI for Energy&quot; innovation mission and policy dialogue in 2026, guiding future joint programming and partnerships.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country is mentioned in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
